          "settings": {
            "html": "<div class=\"hc-site\" id=\"top\"><main class=\"hc-hero\" id=\"main\"><div class=\"hc-wrap hc-hero-grid\"><div><p class=\"hc-kicker\">Thoughtful care, clearer next steps</p><h1>Feel better about taking care of you.</h1><p class=\"hc-lead\">Clear checkup options, practical preparation guidance, and a straightforward way to request your next visit.</p><div class=\"hc-actions\"><a class=\"hc-button\" href=\"#calculator\">Find the right checkup <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"hc-button hc-button-secondary\" href=\"#packages\">View packages</a></div><p class=\"hc-hero-note\">Explore your options today. Final pricing and availability are confirmed before booking.</p></div><div class=\"hc-hero-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A clinician speaking with an older patient in a bright consultation room\"></div></div></main></div>"
