          "settings": {
            "html": "<div class=\"hc-site hc-cream\"><section class=\"hc-section\" id=\"doctors\"><div class=\"hc-wrap\"><p class=\"hc-kicker\">Areas of care</p><h2>Care that meets you where you are.</h2><p class=\"hc-narrow\">Explore the types of support available throughout a checkup journey.</p><div class=\"hc-card-grid\"><article class=\"hc-card hc-doctor\"><span class=\"hc-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><div><h3>Family medicine</h3><p>Everyday health questions<br>Ongoing care guidance</p></div></article><article class=\"hc-card hc-doctor\"><span class=\"hc-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><div><h3>Internal medicine</h3><p>Broader health reviews<br>Next-step planning</p></div></article><article class=\"hc-card hc-doctor\"><span class=\"hc-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><div><h3>Preventive care</h3><p>Screening conversations<br>Practical preparation</p></div></article></div></div></section></div>"
