          "id": "00000011",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "html",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<div class=\"hc-site\"><section class=\"hc-section\" id=\"visit\"><div class=\"hc-wrap\"><p class=\"hc-kicker\">Know before you go</p><h2>Your visit, step by step.</h2><div class=\"hc-steps\"><div class=\"hc-step\"><h3>Choose and request</h3><p>Pick a package and send a request. Our team confirms the date, final price, and any preparation.</p></div><div class=\"hc-step\"><h3>Prepare with confidence</h3><p>Bring a valid ID, medication list, and HMO details if relevant. Ask whether fasting is needed for your selected tests.</p></div><div class=\"hc-step\"><h3>Come as you are</h3><p>Meet the care team, complete the tests, and get guidance on what your results mean.</p></div></div></div></section></div>"
