          "id": "00000016",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "html",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<div class=\"hc-site\"><section class=\"hc-section\"><div class=\"hc-wrap\"><p class=\"hc-kicker\">Why clarity matters</p><h2>Make the next step feel simple.</h2><div class=\"hc-card-grid\"><article class=\"hc-card\"><h3>Compare with confidence</h3><p>See what each package includes and how optional tests affect the estimate.</p></article><article class=\"hc-card\"><h3>Prepare for your visit</h3><p>Know what to bring and which preparation questions to ask before booking.</p></article><article class=\"hc-card\"><h3>Request without pressure</h3><p>Send your preferred package and receive the next steps by email.</p></article></div></div></section></div>"
