          "id": "00000018",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "html",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<div class=\"hc-site hc-cream\"><section class=\"hc-section\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"hc-wrap hc-narrow\"><p class=\"hc-kicker\">Good to know</p><h2>Frequently asked questions.</h2><details><summary>Do I need to fast before a checkup?</summary><p>Some blood tests require fasting and others do not. The clinic will confirm your preparation after reviewing your chosen tests. Do not stop medication unless your clinician advises it.</p></details><details><summary>Is my request an appointment?</summary><p>No. The clinic will contact you to confirm availability, timing, and final price.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use my HMO?</summary><p>Coverage varies by plan and test. Search the provider list above, then ask the clinic to verify your exact benefits.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change my package later?</summary><p>Yes. Tell the clinic what you want to change when they contact you. A clinician can help choose appropriate tests.</p></details></div></section></div>"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
